      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daūdi kūpeelela kū mapandī gangī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi wīnga ī Gaasi, ūpeelela kwipilinga lya Adulamu, a bakūlūye na banhū bangī a ba mu kaya ya ng'wa ise aho bigwa, būja ko nabo kwisangīja nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye abo baalī na makoye, na a babo baalī na būgasa, na a bose abo baalī batizunīlījaga nū būsugi wa mu sī yabo, būyūnkūūbīja; ūbiza ntongeeji wabo. A ba kūja bakūnondeelaga hose hose būshika bagosha magana anè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi wīnga ho hado ūja Misipa ya Moabu, ūūkanomba ū ntemi wa Moabu alīhaya, “Nalīkwikūmbīlīja ūng'wanukūle ū baba nū mayū, bize bikale hamò nag'ho kūshisha nadeebe ūmo alīnītīla ū Mulungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ūbaleka ū kū ng'wa ntemi wa Moabu, bikala nang'hwe ī likanza ī lyose īlo Daūdi walī ū ng'wipandī lya kwibisīla lyenīlo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo walīho ng'hangi Gaadi, ūng'wīla ū Daūdi, “Ūtizikala ū ng'wipandī lya kwibisīla lyenīlī. Jaga mu sī ya Yuda.” Na lūūlū ū Daūdi wīnga ko ū kwenūko, ūja kwipoolu lya Helesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo wigwa gīkī ū Daūdi na a banhū bakwe babonilwe. Na lūūlū lūshikū lūmò ū Saulo walī n'ichimu lyakwe mu nkono igaashije mu mbeho ya ntī gwa nshishi, kū sī ya ngūlya gwa Gibea, walī hamò nabo pye a batūmami bakwe, baalī bīmīīla bampīndije. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwitulwa ū Saulo wandya kūbawīla alīhaya; “Bing'we Babenjamini, alidegelekagi, ī gete hamo shi ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yese ng'wenūyū akūng'winha būlī ūmò wing'we ilaale na ngūnda gwa mizabibu? Nūūlū hamo akūng'wīta a bose ūmo mugelelile mubize bataale ba mabità ga bashilikale shihūmbī, na ga bashilikale igana igana? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamo ī yenīyo h'īnguno īyo yang'wenhelegije kūnilīīla gwīnda ya kūyūnibisa ī mihayo? Nguno ndūhū nūūlū ūmò wing'we ūyo akūnimanīkījaga, nūūlū aho mukūbonaga gīkī nū ng'witūnja wane akūbeejaga ilagane nū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yese! Atīho gete nūūlū ūmo wing'we ūyo anidīlīīlile ū nene, nūūlū ū wa kūnimanya gīkī ū ng'witūnja wane wamiipije masala ū ntūmami wane, nose akwikalaga ūnikūngīla, gīt'ūmo alītīla nī haha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Doegi, ūyo nang'hwe walī wīmīīla hamò na a batūmami ba ng'wa Saulo; ūhaya, “Ū nene naalī namonile ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yese, akiza ī Nobu kūlī Ahimeleki ū ng'wana Ahitubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahimeleki ūmūūja na SEEBA kūlwa nguno yakwe; ūng'winha na shiigunaanīlo, pyī nī līlūshū lya ng'wa Goliati ū Mfilisiti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo kūbabūlaga bagabīji ba ng'wa SEEBA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūlagīja witanwa ū ngabīji Ahimeleki ū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahitubu, nī kaya ya ng'wa ise ī yose, abo baalī bagabīji ba Nobu; pye a bose biza ū kū ng'wa ntemi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūhaya, “Bebe ng'wana Ahitubu, degelekaga.” Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Hayaga baba ntemi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Saulo ūmūūja, “Nibūlī ū bebe nū ng'witūnja o ng'wa Yese ng'wanilīīlile gwīnda ya kūnītīla mihayo yabūbi mu mbisīla? Nguno ūkang'winha migatī na lūshū, ūmūūgīja na kūlī Mulungu; nose ūūyo wanigomelile gete, hama akwikalaga ūnikūngīla gīt'ūmo alītīla nī haha!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Ahimeleki ūnshokeja ū ntemi ūhaya, “Baba ntemi, ū mu batūmami bako bose, nani ū nsanyiwa gītī Daūdi ū nkwīlīma wa ntemi; ūyo nīyo alī ntaale wa bashilikale abo bakakūlang'hanaga ū bebe, ūyo nīyo akūjiwe hataale ū mu kaya yako? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, ū lwenūlo lwalī lūkangala lwa kwandya ū nene ū kūmūūgīja ū kūlī Mulungu? Ītī gīko na hado yaya! Ū ntemi ni atizagūnsola būbi ū ntūmami wako, nūūlū ī kaya ya ng'wa baba, nguno ū nene ntūmami wako natīmanile gete na hado yaya ī mihayo yose yenīyī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntemi ūnshokeja alīhaya, “Ahimeleki ūlīcha gete, nīyo pyī nī kaya ya ng'wa so ī yose!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūbalagīja a bashilikale bakwe abo baalī hamò nang'hwe; ūbawīla, “Basangagi a bagabīji ba ng'wa SEEBA mukababūlage, nguno nabo balī kū lwandī lo ng'wa Daūdi. Baalī badeebile ī gīkī alīnipeela, alīyo būleka ū kūniwīla.” Gwike a bashilikale ba ntemi bogoha ū kūbagoloolela makono a bagabīji ba ng'wa SEEBA gīkī bababūlage. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū ntemi ūnagīja ū Doegi ūng'wīla, “Basangage ho ū bebe a bagabīji benabo ūkababūlage.” Ng'hana ū Doegi ū muna Edomi ūbasanga ho ūūkababūlaga; ū lūshikū lwenūlo ūbūlaga banhū makūmi anaane na batanò abo baazwalaga ifoodi ja kitaani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū nzengo gwa bagabīji ū gwa Nobu ūgūkenaagūla wa līlūshū; ūbamala pye a banhū ba ng'wenūmo, bagosha na bakīma, pye na a baana na a beleele; būyaga nī ng'ombe jamo nī nzobe nī ng'holo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūpūlūgūka ūmò, Abiasali ng'witūnja o ng'wa Ahimeleki ū ng'wana Ahitubu, ūpeela ūja kūlī Daūdi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washika ūng'wīla ū Daūdi gīkī, ū Saulo wababūlagaga pye a bagabīji ba ng'wa SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Daūdi ūng'wīla ū Abiasali, “Ū lūshikū lwenūlo aho namona ū Doegi ū muna Edomu, nakadeeba gīkī akūng'wīla ū Saulo. A banhū ba kaya ya ng'wa so naabenhelejaga nene pye a bose ū kūcha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ikalaga hamò naane, wīnje ū boobà; nguno ū munhū ūyo alībūkooba ū būpanga wako h'ūyo akūbūkoobaga nū wane. Alīyo ū bebe ūlū wikala hamò nane ūkūbiza ūlī mhola.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.22.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
